  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> This effect only works on mind-affecting talents. A threnodic talents affects undead creatures (even mindless undead) as if they were not immune to mind-affecting effects, but has no effect on living creatures. This metamagic does not give you the effects of the Mind sphere’s Expanded Charm talent.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost:</strong> +2 spell points</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/metamagic-feats#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
